{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955790/extras/0bd7e5e1dc92f680564571bf86c07d25.avif?t=1759381359\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizable Loadouts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each match, craft your <strong>Loadout</strong> by selecting a unique mix of units, structures, and upgrades. Your choices define your entire strategy \u2014 no tech trees, no mid-match unlocks beyond what you brought. Plan ahead, commit, and execute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955790/extras/7d39bd62b16f0b4167e8a013ff76a0b5.avif?t=1759381359\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cubic Annihilation</i> delivers tight, fast-paced RTS gameplay. Control your forces in real time and make every decision count. There\u2019s no room for macro spam \u2014 only quick thinking, smart positioning, and pure tactical execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955790/extras/e9f43f38241d19a46956ca01c70e8a51.avif?t=1759381359\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Land, Sea, and Air Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate all domains of battle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ground</strong> units form the backbone \u2014 versatile and essential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Air</strong> units offer mobility and pressure \u2014 perfect for flanking or surgical strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sea</strong> units dominate aquatic maps with powerful long-range firepower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master combined-arms warfare or specialize to overwhelm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955790/extras/ecc9d359764907cd53742671768e955f.avif?t=1759381359\" width=1380 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Showdowns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against other players in 1v1 or team-based multiplayer battles. Test your strategies, refine your loadouts, and stay sharp \u2014 every match brings something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skirmish Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a <strong>1v1 duel against the AI</strong> and sharpen your skills. Pick your challenge from four distinct difficulties \u2014 <strong>Easy, Medium, Hard, and Cheater</strong>. Start simple, push your limits, or face the ultimate unfair fight where the rules bend against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in <strong>Ranked Mode</strong> and climb the global ladder. Wins push you forward, losses force you to learn. Only consistent, well-rounded commanders will rise to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Command?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cubic Annihilation</i> is a clean, tactical RTS with no fluff. Massive army variety. Brutal decision-making.<br>Choose your loadout. Upgrade your units. Spend your resources \u2014 and outplay everyone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955790?t=1759381359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955790/b2bdd15ec2de2a1cc8395cd22e2a908cc85c118b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759381359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor