ou to learn. Only consistent, well-rounded commanders will rise to the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Command?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cubic Annihilation</i> is a clean, tactical RTS with no fluff. Massive army variety. Brutal decision-making.<br>Choose your loadout. Upgrade your units. Spend your resources \u2014 and outplay everyone.</p>","developers":["John Corneloup"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3397060","name":"Cubic Annihilation"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955790/0a0e1bfb04c87f5bfab954349fa4beb733abd12b/header.jpg?t=1759381359","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (Intel Only if no native support)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU (e.g. M1 GPU or Intel Iris)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs well on entry-level Apple Silicon and older Intel Macs</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or better (Universal build preferred)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1/M2 GPU or dedicated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Native Apple Silicon build recommended for best per